		<td width="5%" valign="top"><b>Question:</b></td>
		<td>
			Omens of War - Will you Buy it?
			<table>
				<tr>
					<td style="padding-top: 2ex;">
						<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
							<tr>
								<td>Great Expansion - A Must Buy</td>
								<td width="7">&nbsp;</td>
								<td nowrap="nowrap"><span style="white-space: nowrap;"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/poll_left.gif" alt="" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/poll_middle.gif" width="78" height="12" alt="-" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/poll_right.gif" alt="" /></span>16 (29.6%)</td>
							</tr>
