							</tr>
							<tr>
								<td>Not Till SoE fixes GoD</td>
								<td width="7">&nbsp;</td>
								<td nowrap="nowrap"><span style="white-space: nowrap;"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/poll_left.gif" alt="" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/poll_middle.gif" width="14" height="12" alt="-" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/poll_right.gif" alt="" /></span>3 (5.6%)</td>
							</tr>
							<tr>
								<td>Not Till SoE fixes the lame Spells and AA's in OoW</td>
								<td width="7">&nbsp;</td>
								<td nowrap="nowrap"><span style="white-space: nowrap;"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/poll_left.gif" alt="" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/poll_middle.gif" width="14" height="12" alt="-" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/poll_right.gif" alt="" /></span>3 (5.6%)</td>
							</tr>
							<tr>
								<td>I don't Care, I Already Canceled</td>
								<td width="7">&nbsp;</td>
								<td nowrap="nowrap"><span style="white-space: nowrap;"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/poll_left.gif" alt="" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/poll_middle.gif" width="49" height="12" alt="-" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/poll_right.gif" alt="" /></span>10 (18.5%)</td>
							</tr>
							<tr>
								<td>I might buy it just so the pop ups stop</td>
								<td width="7">&nbsp;</td>
								<td nowrap="nowrap"><span style="white-space: nowrap;"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/poll_left.gif" alt="" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/poll_middle.gif" width="84" height="12" alt="-" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/poll_right.gif" alt="" /></span>17 (31.5%)</td>
