	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg11179"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=402" title="View the profile of Callon">Callon</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Drolvarg Guardian<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 299<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/opus.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Warpig<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=402"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:murgen21@yahoo.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1047.msg11179#msg11179"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1047.msg11179#msg11179">Re: Omens of War - Will you Buy it?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #34 on:</b> September 14, 2004, 05:07:35 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Thats what LDoNs are for. You know you at least get 20% of your level in a single one. So thats one other possibility. </div><br />LDoNs are lame exp at L65.  The normals have a lot of high 50s mobs so it&#039;s lousy exp.   The Hards often take too many party resources to do as fast as other zones in the game where you can get a much better exp rate.<br /><br />Tactics, CoD undead, sol ro tower, elems, sewers #1, tipt, vxed, kod&#039;taz... they can all blow away ldon hards to varying degrees for exp right now.  At L70, who knows.  Will they add a higher level of ldon that contains no blue to 65 mobs?  All of these zones, some a lot more than others, have at least some blue con mobs though and you&#039;ll no longer get a bonus on those.&nbsp; Anything short of sol ro tower or beyond will be really lame.&nbsp; 
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg11215"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=745" title="View the profile of Needaa">Needaa</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Female.gif" alt="Female" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 24<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								<a href="http://edit.yahoo.com/config/send_webmesg?.target=miladymouse"><img src="http://opi.yahoo.com/online?u=miladymouse&amp;m=g&amp;t=0" alt="miladymouse" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="aim:goim?screenname=miladymouse&amp;message=Hi.+Are+you+there?"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/aim.gif" alt="miladymouse" border="0" /></a><br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=745"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1047.msg11215#msg11215"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1047.msg11215#msg11215">Re: Omens of War - Will you Buy it?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #35 on:</b> September 16, 2004, 10:00:53 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Went to buy it last night and the sales clerk got really upset...He wanted to know why I&#039;d buy the upgrade to EQ when EQ2 was due out very shortly and in his opinion was a much better game. <br /><br />In conversation, it came out that he has never played EQ. <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/wtf1.gif" alt="WTF" border="0" />&nbsp; So, I asked the logical question:&nbsp; Who made you an expert?&nbsp; Dumbfounded, he shut up and finally sold me what I wanted.&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cool.gif" alt="Cool" border="0" /> <br /><br />Now then, the question arises, were these salespeople instructed to divert peeps away from Omens; and if so, by whom? <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/banghead2.gif" alt="banghead2" border="0" />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Needaa Spiritfyter<br />Guild Leader, Dark Empire
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
