							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1047.msg11257#msg11257"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1047.msg11257#msg11257">Re: Omens of War - Will you Buy it?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #37 on:</b> September 17, 2004, 04:32:26 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Just an FYI. Normal Ldon, level 66, 4% regular exp TOTAL off a slaughter 60, with 100% exp going to normal. <br /><br />LDON is NOT an option to level 70. In fact, from what I hear, LDOn doesn&#039;t scale past 65. We had one level 65 in our group, and he only got 49 points for the win.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
