							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Xaanru 66th lvl Archon of Marr <br />&lt;Sons of Kings&gt; Rodcet Nife <br />Grandmaster Smith(250)* GM Trophy<br />Grandmaster Jeweler (250)<br />Grandmaster Tailor (250)<br />Master Baker(200)<br />Master Fletcher (200)<br />Master Jeweler (200)<br />Master Brewer (200)<br />Master Potter (194)<br />Master Fisherman (186)<br />Master Drunk (189)
